she is your daughter?

258
00:30:16,270 --> 00:30:17,650
Come on.

259
00:30:22,650 --> 00:30:24,360
What the hell?

260
00:31:00,440 --> 00:31:02,150
Okay.

261
00:31:02,360 --> 00:31:04,570
Now do you see 
what I'm talking about?

262
00:31:04,780 --> 00:31:06,360
Will you take these handcuffs 
off me?

263
00:31:06,570 --> 00:31:08,990
No. Get walking.

264
00:31:09,200 --> 00:31:11,830
There's a fire-Iookout tower 
on the far side of Toluca Lake.

265
00:31:12,040 --> 00:31:14,750
- It should have a radio. 
- Fuck you, you stupid cop.

266
00:31:15,370 --> 00:31:18,250
This place is completely cut off.

267
00:31:19,040 --> 00:31:21,550
- You have no idea what's going on. 
- Hey!

268
00:31:22,710 --> 00:31:24,840
Hey, you up there!

269
00:31:26,050 --> 00:31:28,140
I'm a police officer!

270
00:31:32,220 --> 00:31:33,890
What's going on?

271
00:31:41,570 --> 00:31:43,400
What is that?

272
00:31:47,910 --> 00:31:49,240
Stand back.

273
00:31:52,740 --> 00:31:55,200
Jesus Christ, shoot it.

274
00:32:08,220 --> 00:32:09,720
Stay where you are!

275
00:32:11,430 --> 00:32:12,890
Stop!

276
00:33:51,070 --> 00:33:54,070
MIDWICH ELEMENTARY SCHOOL

277
00:34:05,830 --> 00:34:06,840
Sharon!

278
00:34:18,600 --> 00:34:21,980
The foes of the righteous will be condemned

279
00:34:45,170 --> 00:34:46,170
MAIN OFFICE

280
00:35:36,300 --> 00:35:38,050
<i>Rose.</i>

281
00:35:49,100 --> 00:35:50,110
COUNTRY

282
00:35:51,110 --> 00:35:52,070
HOME

283
00:35:53,070 --> 00:35:54,070
LOYALTY

284
00:35:54,900 --> 00:35:55,900
GOD

285
00:35:57,650 --> 00:35:59,910
<i>Mrs. Da Silva, 
I am an officer of the law...</i>

286
00:36:00,120 --> 00:36:01,990
<i>...and I will take you to safety.</i>

287
00:36:02,200 --> 00:36:05,080
<i>Mrs. Da Silva, 
I am an officer of the law...</i>

288
00:36:05,290 --> 00:36:07,250
<i>...and I will take you to safety.</i>

289
00:36:07,460 --> 00:36:10,130
- Why don't you let me do that? 
- Ninety percent of the time...

290
00:36:10,330 --> 00:36:11,670
...when a wife takes a run...

291
00:36:11,880 --> 00:36:14,170
...she takes the daughter 
to a place like this...

292
00:36:14,340 --> 00:36:16,380
...I'd say she's damn mad 
at her husband.

293
00:36:18,010 --> 00:36:20,340
You like hauling skeletons 
out of your family closet?

294
00:36:20,510 --> 00:36:23,970
No, not all the time, but we're 
driving on top of them right now.

295
00:36:24,180 --> 00:36:26,600
Coal fire's still burning 
underneath.

296
00:36:26,810 --> 00:36:28,690
You see the barbershop over there?

297
00:36:29,190 --> 00:36:31,730
- Used to be my father's. 
- Your father?

298
00:36:33,190 --> 00:36:34,980
He's dead.

299
00:36:35,360 --> 00:36:37,740
November '74, 
when the fire caught.

300
00:36:37,940 --> 00:36:41,280
They tried to evacuate this place 
as quick as they could...

301
00:36:41,490 --> 00:36:44,530
...but it was hellish, people were 
dying and disappearing.

302
00:36:44,660 --> 00:36:47,330
Hell, they couldn't even find 
half the bodies.

303
00:36:47,540 --> 00:36:49,120
That was the end of Silent Hill.

304
00:36:49,330 --> 00:36:52,500
These were good people, 
most of them.

305
00:36:52,790 --> 00:36:55,090
Some, you might say deserved it.

306
00:36:55,300 --> 00:36:56,840
A little bit.

307
00:37:12,730 --> 00:37:14,650
Sharon!

308
00:38:46,280 --> 00:38:47,530
Sharon.

309
00:38:47,870 --> 00:38:49,990
WITCH

310
00:38:51,910 --> 00:38:53,200
Where are you hiding?

311
00:39:11,390 --> 00:39:12,430
Wait!

312
00:39:40,170 --> 00:39:41,630
Come on.

313
00:39:42,170 --> 00:39:44,010
Oh, God.

314
00:39:44,380 --> 00:39:45,920
Come on.

315
00:39:51,300 --> 00:39:57,190
Help me. Oh, God. 
Please, please, help me. Help...

316
00:39:59,060 --> 00:40:05,360
Help me. Please, help me. 
Help me. Help me, please.

317
00:40:58,370 --> 00:41:00,370
It's happening again.

318
00:42:07,690 --> 00:42:10,240
Come on! Come on!

319
00:42:24,370 --> 00:42:26,080
Rose!

320
00:42:27,710 --> 00:42:29,420
Sharon!

321
00:42:33,220 --> 00:42:35,260
Rose!

322
00:43:38,990 --> 00:43:40,580
Rose!

323
00:43:51,500 --> 00:43:53,170
Rose.

324
00:44:08,640 --> 00:44:10,860
- Rose! 
- Put your mask on.

325
00:44:11,060 --> 00:44:13,690
Rose, where are you?

326
00:44:19,950 --> 00:44:22,490
- I felt her. 
- You what?

327
00:44:22,700 --> 00:44:24,040
Her perfume.

328
00:44:25,410 --> 00:44:26,790
- She was here. 
- Who was?

329
00:44:26,080 --> 00:44:29,040
- My wife. 
- She wasn't here. Put this mask on.

330
00:44:29,250 --> 00:44:32,000
- Perfume. 
- Breathe. Through that mask.

331
00:44:33,500 --> 00:44:36,090
Come on, let's go. 
We're gonna go this way.

332
00:44:36,300 --> 00:44:38,090
Chris, come on.

333
00:44:40,090 --> 00:44:41,970
- She was here. 
- No, no, she wasn't here.

334
00:44:42,180 --> 00:44:43,140
I know it.

335
00:44:58,950 --> 00:44:59,280
Come on.

336
00:45:00,410 --> 00:45:02,160
Come on. Let's keep looking.

337
00:45:28,680 --> 00:45:30,850
Get off! Get off! Get off!

338
00:45:34,690 --> 00:45:36,570
Get me that pipe.

339
00:45:37,480 --> 00:45:39,690
Rose, the pipe!

340
00:45:40,740 --> 00:45:42,860
Okay. Okay.

341
00:45:44,490 --> 00:45:47,200
- I got it. I got it. 
- Quick, come on!

342
00:46:02,630 --> 00:46:04,390
Can we get out of here?

343
00:46:04,970 --> 00:46:06,550
We're trapped.

344
00:46:07,180 --> 00:46:08,640
Last mag.

345
00:46:08,850 --> 00:46:11,480
- That's all the bullets you got? 
- Yeah.

346
00:46:14,230 --> 00:46:15,810
Thanks.

347
00:46:27,950 --> 00:46:29,160
You hear that?

348
00:46:37,210 --> 00:46:39,050
That's him.

349
00:46:44,380 --> 00:46:46,390
Stay down! Stay down!

350
00:46:46,590 --> 00:46:48,680
Jesus Christ.

351
00:46:50,310 --> 00:46:52,180
Get down!

352
00:46:59,270 --> 00:47:00,860
Shit!

353
00:47:53,490 --> 00:47:54,450
What?

354
00:48:34,160 --> 00:48:35,490
What the fuck?

355
00:48:37,250 --> 00:48:38,210
What the fuck?

356
00:48:40,540 --> 00:48:43,210
You saw that, right? 
That was real?

357
00:48:45,710 --> 00:48:47,130
What the fuck is going on?

358
00:48:47,340 --> 00:48:50,050
All right, I know this is crazy. I know.

359
00:48:50,260 --> 00:48:52,640
We gotta calm right down, 
because my kid is not here...

360
00:48:52,850 --> 00:48:55,770
...and I've gotta find her 
before this happens again.

361
00:48:56,560 --> 00:48:58,640
I don't even know where to start.

362
00:48:59,060 --> 00:49:00,730
I found this.

363
00:49:00,940 --> 00:49:02,900
It's from a hotel.

364
00:49:03,110 --> 00:49:06,030
I don't know where it is, 
but she is in this hotel.

365
00:49:06,780 --> 00:49:08,440
Hotel?

366
00:49:15,240 --> 00:49:17,290
It's gonna be okay.

367
00:49:19,040 --> 00:49:21,040
We're gonna be okay.

368
00:49:34,010 --> 00:49:35,890
Now, don't be trying 
anything, all right?

369
00:49:36,100 --> 00:49:38,100
We got men up here 
all night long.

370
00:49:38,310 --> 00:49:41,020
We're gonna find your wife, 
we're gonna find your daughter.

371
00:49:41,230 --> 00:49:44,150
Can't have civilians 
wandering around on their own.

372
00:49:44,810 --> 00:49:46,940
You're not telling me everything.

373
00:49:48,230 --> 00:49:49,530
What really happened up here?

374
00:49:49,740 --> 00:49:52,030
Just let it rest in peace.

375
00:49:55,280 --> 00:49:57,660
<i>- Directory assistance. 
- Toluca County Archives, please.</i>

376
00:49:57,870 --> 00:49:59,370
<i>One moment.</i>

377
00:49:59,700 --> 00:50:02,040
<i>- Archives? 
- Yeah, listen.</i>

378
00:50:02,250 --> 00:50:04,830
Do you have the records there 
from Silent Hill?

379
00:50:05,040 --> 00:50:08,170
<i>- Which records, sir? 
- The police records.</i>

380
00:50:08,380 --> 00:50:10,840
<i>Sorry, sir, 
those records are confidential.</i>

381
00:50:11,010 --> 00:50:13,180
No, no, I can't... 
No, listen, I...

382
00:50:13,380 --> 00:50:15,590
<i>Sorry, sir, 
I can't access that information.</i>

383
00:50:15,800 --> 00:50:17,260
<i>- Listen, goddamn it. 
- Sir.</i>

384
00:50:17,470 --> 00:50:18,850
<i>- This is an emergency. 
- I can't...</i>

385
00:50:19,060 --> 00:50:21,060
<i>I can't help you.</i>

386
00:50:37,320 --> 00:50:39,990
They used to say 
this place was haunted.

387
00:50:40,660 --> 00:50:42,750
I think they were right.

388
00:50:43,290 --> 00:50:44,580
GRAND HOTEL

389
00:50:52,210 --> 00:50:54,800
<i>Help! No!</i>

390
00:50:55,010 --> 00:50:56,840
<i>- Stay away. 
- Come on.</i>

391
00:50:57,050 --> 00:50:59,930
Stay away, sinner.

392
00:51:00,140 --> 00:51:01,470
Get back!

393
00:51:03,680 --> 00:51:05,350
It's here.

394
00:51:07,230 --> 00:51:10,270
Faith is our destroyer. 
Faith has brought us doom.

395
00:51:10,270 --> 00:51:11,480
- Get back! 
- Hey, hey!

396
00:51:11,690 --> 00:51:14,610
- Get back! 
- Hey, stop.

397
00:51:14,820 --> 00:51:17,200
Think you of thee 
who cast the first stone.

398
00:51:17,410 --> 00:51:19,740
Lambs without a shepherd, 
shepherd without a flock.

399
00:51:20,410 --> 00:51:22,500
It's your sins which hold you here.

400
00:51:22,700 --> 00:51:24,250
- Stop your lies! 
- Calm down.

401
00:51:24,460 --> 00:51:25,410
Calm down, it's okay.

402
00:51:25,620 --> 00:51:27,710
- We're not gonna hurt you. 
- She's gone.

403
00:51:28,750 --> 00:51:30,290
What's your name?

404
00:51:30,670 --> 00:51:34,220
Anna. My name is Anna.

405
00:51:34,420 --> 00:51:36,470
What's going on here, Anna? 
Who was that?

406
00:51:36,680 --> 00:51:39,720
- I've seen her before. 
- Dahlia was cast out.

407
00:51:39,930 --> 00:51:42,010
Not even the darkness wants her.

408
00:51:42,220 --> 00:51:44,810
- She's lost her daughter too. 
- What?

409
00:51:45,020 --> 00:51:50,360
- Sinners deserve to lose their spawn. 
- What are you doing here, Anna?

410
00:51:52,150 --> 00:51:54,690
Mother needs more food.

411
00:51:55,320 --> 00:51:56,900
You mean there are 
other people here?

412
00:52:00,030 --> 00:52:01,990
Christabella keeps us safe.

413
00:52:02,200 --> 00:52:04,620
- Anna. 
- We take refuge in the church.

414
00:52:05,160 --> 00:52:08,040
Anna, listen to me.

415
00:52:08,620 --> 00:52:11,000
I've lost my daughter. 
She's all alone.

416
00:52:11,340 --> 00:52:14,000
Can you imagine how frightened 
she must feel?

417
00:52:14,210 --> 00:52:16,170
Tell me, have you seen her?

418
00:52:16,380 --> 00:52:17,760
Do you know where she is?

419
00:52:21,550 --> 00:52:24,470
If she has faith, she might survive.

420
00:52:24,680 --> 00:52:25,640
If not...

421
00:52:28,640 --> 00:52:29,730
I'm taking this.

422
00:52:32,060 --> 00:52:33,770
Have you seen this?

423
00:52:34,360 --> 00:52:36,610
I've seen it at the school.

424
00:52:37,190 --> 00:52:40,990
It's on all the buildings 
the elders of my elders built.

425
00:52:41,160 --> 00:52:45,620
It's a symbol of our unity, 
a symbol of our faith.

426
00:52:57,090 --> 00:52:58,760
Rose, look at this.

427
00:53:00,840 --> 00:53:03,970
- What is it? 
- Just like yours.

428
00:53:05,430 --> 00:53:08,850
- Where did you find it? 
- They're all over the floor.

429
00:53:23,160 --> 00:53:24,330
Rose.

430
00:53:25,120 --> 00:53:26,660
Check this out.

431
00:53:28,540 --> 00:53:32,670
- What number did you take this from? 
- 111.

432
00:53:34,670 --> 00:53:36,960
We gotta go to room 111.

433
00:54:42,990 --> 00:54:44,570
SILENT HILL POLICE RECORDS

434
00:55:10,510 --> 00:55:12,100
Gucci.

435
00:55:42,670 --> 00:55:44,670
<i>- Directory assistance. 
- Yeah.</i>

436
00:55:45,340 --> 00:55:47,890
Toluca County Orphanage, please.

437
00:55:48,090 --> 00:55:50,100
<i>One moment, please.</i>

438
00:55:52,010 --> 00:55:54,310
<i>- Yes, I have that information for you. 
- Yeah.</i>

439
00:55:55,310 --> 00:55:57,480
Can you give me that address?

440
00:56:06,320 --> 00:56:09,870
We are wandering far 
from refuge here.

441
00:56:12,080 --> 00:56:14,120
Let's keep her with us. 
She's all we got.

442
00:56:42,230 --> 00:56:43,860
There's no room 111.

443
00:56:44,070 --> 00:56:46,490
The first burning.

444
00:56:47,360 --> 00:56:50,860
- What is it, Anna? 
- The first burning.

445
00:56:51,070 --> 00:56:52,990
Before the town had a name.

446
00:56:53,200 --> 00:56:56,660
The elders of my elders 
kept us pure.

447
00:56:57,250 --> 00:56:59,580
The founders of this town 
were witch- hunters.

448
00:57:00,080 --> 00:57:02,540
Burning the witch 
held back the darkness.

449
00:57:02,750 --> 00:57:04,380
It stopped the apocalypse.

450
00:57:10,300 --> 00:57:11,890
It's here.

451
00:57:28,280 --> 00:57:30,490
There's a room in here.

452
00:57:41,920 --> 00:57:43,540
Look at this.

453
00:57:51,510 --> 00:57:53,050
Here.

454
00:57:53,760 --> 00:57:55,430
Damn.

455
00:58:10,570 --> 00:58:12,780
What is this place?

456
00:58:12,990 --> 00:58:15,160
I don't know. 
We're in the next building.

457
00:58:15,370 --> 00:58:17,450
Some factory, maybe?

458
00:58:19,160 --> 00:58:21,290
Looks like there was a fire.

459
00:58:50,400 --> 00:58:52,070
Rose!

460
00:59:22,890 --> 00:59:24,730
Who are you?

461
00:59:37,160 --> 00:59:38,910
It's okay.

462
00:59:40,160 --> 00:59:43,450
Don't be scared. 
I promise I'm not gonna hurt you.

463
01:00:01,760 --> 01:00:03,430
Rose?

464
01:00:25,290 --> 01:00:27,620
Okay. Come on.

465
01:00:27,790 --> 01:00:29,500
Come on.

466
01:00:33,800 --> 01:00:36,880
It's okay. Hey.

467
01:00:41,600 --> 01:00:43,260
It's okay.

468
01:00:50,400 --> 01:00:51,690
It's okay.

469
01:00:51,900 --> 01:00:54,070
I'm not gonna hurt you.

470
01:01:04,370 --> 01:01:05,580
Oh, my God.

471
01:01:06,240 --> 01:01:08,290
You could be her twin.

472
01:01:12,500 --> 01:01:13,590
Are you Alessa?

473
01:01:16,250 --> 01:01:18,340
Where's my Sharon?

474
01:01:19,050 --> 01:01:20,840
Look at me.

475
01:01:22,340 --> 01:01:24,300
I'm burning.

476
01:01:27,140 --> 01:01:28,640
Rose?

477
01:01:31,520 --> 01:01:32,600
Rose? My God.

478
01:01:33,560 --> 01:01:36,070
- How did you get over there? 
- Where is she?

479
01:01:40,450 --> 01:01:41,820
Grab onto it.

480
01:01:43,240 --> 01:01:46,830
- Now swing back around. 
- Okay.

481
01:01:51,620 --> 01:01:53,000
- Are you all right? 
- Yeah.

482
01:01:53,380 --> 01:01:55,090
What the hell 
were you doing over there?

483
01:01:55,290 --> 01:01:56,800
You're gonna get yourself killed.

484
01:01:57,550 --> 01:01:59,670
I think I just saw Dahlia's daughter.

485
01:02:01,380 --> 01:02:03,050
She was the one 
that brought us here.

486
01:02:03,260 --> 01:02:04,510
What are you talking about?

487
01:02:04,720 --> 01:02:07,140
She was the one 
that made me crash my car.

488
01:02:07,850 --> 01:02:09,020
Alessa.

489
01:02:09,220 --> 01:02:11,440
We don't say her name.

490
01:02:15,230 --> 01:02:17,730
That's the seal, isn't it, Anna?

491
01:02:18,730 --> 01:02:21,110
The symbol of your faith?

492
01:02:23,860 --> 01:02:26,030
Something terrible happened here.

493
01:02:30,290 --> 01:02:33,460
We have to leave. 
We have to leave!

494
01:02:34,750 --> 01:02:36,960
- The darkness is coming! 
- Let's go.

495
01:02:37,420 --> 01:02:39,000
Let's go!

496
01:02:50,810 --> 01:02:53,060
The church isn't far.

497
01:02:53,270 --> 01:02:55,150
- Run. Run! 
- Rose, come on!

498
01:02:55,350 --> 01:02:57,060
Rose!

499
01:03:06,950 --> 01:03:08,580
Hurry!

500
01:03:15,790 --> 01:03:16,960
Rose.

501
01:03:17,170 --> 01:03:19,670
- Come! 
- We gotta go.

502
01:03:37,310 --> 01:03:39,270
- Rose, come on. 
- I've seen this.

503
01:03:50,910 --> 01:03:52,620
Rose, let's go!

504
01:03:54,700 --> 01:03:57,290
- Cybil! 
- Rose, come on.

505
01:04:05,300 --> 01:04:06,260
Cybil!

506
01:04:06,470 --> 01:04:09,340
You run not towards sanctuary 
but from your fears.

507
01:04:09,510 --> 01:04:12,260
Do not join the others. 
They are deceivers. They are damned.

508
01:04:12,470 --> 01:04:14,020
- We gotta get inside. 
- No!

509
01:04:14,220 --> 01:04:15,810
They are wolves 
in the skin of sheep.

510
01:04:16,020 --> 01:04:18,850
They brought about their own hell. 
They'll take you with them.

511
01:04:19,020 --> 01:04:21,270
- Filth and lies! 
- Hey!

512
01:04:21,480 --> 01:04:22,860
Stop it!

513
01:04:24,190 --> 01:04:27,320
Please. I've seen your daughter. 
I've seen Alessa.

514
01:04:30,370 --> 01:04:32,950
- It's coming! 
- She's dead, isn't she?

515
01:04:33,160 --> 01:04:34,830
Fire doesn't cleanse, it blackens.

516
01:04:35,330 --> 01:04:37,330
- Listen to me. 
- Rose, hurry!

517
01:04:37,710 --> 01:04:39,750
She looks exactly like Sharon.

518
01:04:39,960 --> 01:04:42,380
She brought us here, didn't she?

519
01:04:46,130 --> 01:04:48,340
Why? What does she want?

520
01:04:48,550 --> 01:04:50,180
Evil wakes in vengeance.

521
01:04:50,390 --> 01:04:53,010
Be careful what you choose.

522
01:05:12,990 --> 01:05:14,490
Rose!

523
01:06:03,750 --> 01:06:05,710
- No. 
- Send them back!

524
01:06:06,340 --> 01:06:07,710
No.

525
01:06:08,300 --> 01:06:09,760
We're lost.

526
01:06:20,060 --> 01:06:21,520
This is a sanctuary.

527
01:06:31,570 --> 01:06:35,030
Please, Christabella, 
they lured my Anna.

528
01:06:35,240 --> 01:06:37,700
They gave her to the fiend.

529
01:06:38,030 --> 01:06:41,620
Eleanor, you must remember 
that Anna went against our laws.

530
01:06:41,830 --> 01:06:44,540
She went alone outside 
into the devil's playground.

531
01:06:46,750 --> 01:06:50,050
She was not the responsibility 
of these two strangers.

532
01:06:52,010 --> 01:06:54,130
We'll deal with them later.

533
01:07:00,100 --> 01:07:02,060
Now we must pray.

534
01:07:17,030 --> 01:07:22,040
REVELATION 20:11-15

535
01:07:23,040 --> 01:07:24,460
And then I saw them...

536
01:07:24,460 --> 01:07:27,830
...from whose presence 
earth and heaven fled away.

537
01:07:28,290 --> 01:07:30,880
And no home was left to them.

538
01:07:31,090 --> 01:07:33,170
And then I saw them...

539
01:07:33,380 --> 01:07:36,630
...from whose presence 
earth and heaven fled away.

540
01:07:36,840 --> 01:07:39,550
And no home was left to them.

541
01:07:40,010 --> 01:07:42,770
And I saw the dead, 
the great and the small...

542
01:07:42,970 --> 01:07:46,100
...and they were judged 
according to their deeds.

543
01:07:46,310 --> 01:07:51,360
And I saw the dead, 
the great and the small...

544
01:07:51,570 --> 01:07:54,780
...and they were judged 
according to their deeds.

545
01:07:57,320 --> 01:08:01,660
And anyone's name not found 
written in the book of life...

546
01:08:01,870 --> 01:08:05,040
...they will be thrown 
into the lake of fire.

547
01:08:13,880 --> 01:08:15,470
Toluca County Orphanage

548
01:08:15,510 --> 01:08:18,380
And now I lay me down to sleep...

549
01:08:18,590 --> 01:08:21,510
...I pray the Lord my soul to keep.

550
01:08:21,680 --> 01:08:24,180
If I should die before I wake...

551
01:08:24,680 --> 01:08:27,940
...I pray the Lord my soul to take.

552
01:08:28,140 --> 01:08:29,980
Amen.

553
01:08:30,360 --> 01:08:33,110
All right, girls, into bed. 
Quickly, now.

554
01:08:33,320 --> 01:08:35,900
No better place to be 
on a rainy night.

555
01:08:36,110 --> 01:08:39,490
In you go, Lindsey, thattagirl. 
You've got your bear, that's a girl.

556
01:08:39,700 --> 01:08:42,080
No. No talking 
after lights are out.

557
01:08:45,870 --> 01:08:47,790
Good night, children.

558
01:08:47,080 --> 01:08:50,000
And God bless.

559
01:08:54,000 --> 01:08:56,510
I'm sorry, Sister Margaret, 
this really can't wait.

560
01:08:57,380 --> 01:08:59,220
I can't imagine why.

561
01:09:01,140 --> 01:09:02,930
Nine years ago...

562
01:09:03,140 --> 01:09:05,140
...a baby was left 
outside this orphanage.

563
01:09:05,350 --> 01:09:07,430
My wife and I were the ones 
who adopted her.

564
01:09:07,640 --> 01:09:10,440
I'm very happy for you, 
Mr. Da Silva...

565
01:09:10,650 --> 01:09:14,440
...but I can't give out 
information on our children.

566
01:09:16,070 --> 01:09:17,360
Look.

567
01:09:18,740 --> 01:09:21,700
That girl, she looks 
exactly like my daughter.

568
01:09:20,990 --> 01:09:23,910
I can't help you, I'm sorry.

569
01:09:24,120 --> 01:09:26,740
- It's late. 
- She must be 40 now.

570
01:09:26,950 --> 01:09:28,160
Where can I find her?

571
01:09:29,040 --> 01:09:30,920
This story isn't hers alone...

572
01:09:31,120 --> 01:09:32,830
- ...but all of ours! 
- You people.

573
01:09:33,040 --> 01:09:34,210
You got yourself something.

574
01:09:34,420 --> 01:09:37,380
You know what you got now, Chris? 
How about breaking and entering?

575
01:09:37,590 --> 01:09:39,670
By the looks of this, 
a little assault as well.

576
01:09:40,380 --> 01:09:42,050
Thank you, Thomas.

577
01:09:42,260 --> 01:09:44,890
- This can't go any farther. 
- It won't, Sister.

578
01:09:46,430 --> 01:09:48,560
You know, 
I have some 12-year-olds...

579
01:09:48,770 --> 01:09:51,140
...who cover their tracks 
better than you do.

580
01:09:51,560 --> 01:09:52,850
What's this?

581
01:09:53,060 --> 01:09:54,610
Look, Gucci, do you know her?

582
01:09:54,810 --> 01:09:57,280
Is that my daughter's birth mother?

583
01:10:02,490 --> 01:10:05,950
- Look, turn around. 
- What are you doing?

584
01:10:08,040 --> 01:10:11,080
I knew that girl. I did.

585
01:10:12,250 --> 01:10:14,750
I was told she didn't make it 
through the night.

586
01:10:15,250 --> 01:10:17,170
The night of the fire.

587
01:10:17,460 --> 01:10:19,420
The night of the big fire 
in Silent Hill.

588
01:10:21,800 --> 01:10:24,180
There were these people...

589
01:10:26,140 --> 01:10:27,350
...these fanatics.

590
01:10:27,560 --> 01:10:30,770
What they did 
to that child was terrible.

591
01:10:31,020 --> 01:10:33,730
That was 30 years ago, 
and it's over now.

592
01:10:34,190 --> 01:10:35,770
Not as far as I'm concerned.

593
01:10:36,480 --> 01:10:38,480
What's it gonna be, city boy?

594
01:10:38,690 --> 01:10:41,190
I can put you in jail...

595
01:10:41,400 --> 01:10:43,070
...or you can go home.

596
01:10:43,700 --> 01:10:46,410
And that's your definition of justice?

597
01:10:47,580 --> 01:10:51,290
Many different forms 
of justice, Chris.

598
01:10:52,040 --> 01:10:55,080
See, you've got man's, God's...

599
01:10:56,080 --> 01:10:58,000
...and even the devil's.

600
01:10:59,420 --> 01:11:02,130
Certain forms you just can't control.

601
01:11:03,130 --> 01:11:05,300
So I want you to go home now...

602
01:11:05,720 --> 01:11:07,970
...to your nice warm bed...

603
01:11:08,180 --> 01:11:10,600
...and let me deal with this town...

604
01:11:10,810 --> 01:11:13,520
...and what has happened 
over the last 30 years.

605
01:11:13,730 --> 01:11:16,480
Okay? End of story.

606
01:11:23,780 --> 01:11:27,700
DOMINE DEUS OMNIPOTENS IN CUIUS MANU

607
01:11:28,910 --> 01:11:31,330
Tell me first how you got here.

608
01:11:33,450 --> 01:11:35,920
Honestly, I don't know 
how I got here.

609
01:11:36,120 --> 01:11:39,000
Right now, I've lost my little girl...

610
01:11:39,210 --> 01:11:41,840
...and all I know is that 
I'm supposed to be in this church.

611
01:11:42,050 --> 01:11:44,050
Are you a person of faith?

612
01:11:44,260 --> 01:11:46,510
- I love my daughter. 
- That's not what I asked.

613
01:11:46,930 --> 01:11:48,050
Who are you to judge?

614
01:11:48,260 --> 01:11:51,470
We judge because the souls of history 
hang in the balance.

615
01:11:51,680 --> 01:11:53,310
Because our faith 
has never failed us.

616
01:11:53,520 --> 01:11:55,940
Our faith keeps the darkness 
of hell at bay.

617
01:11:56,140 --> 01:11:59,730
Then use your faith 
to help me find my little girl.

618
01:12:00,400 --> 01:12:02,400
Only the demon knows where she is.

619
01:12:02,610 --> 01:12:04,860
Then tell me, 
where do I find this demon?

620
01:12:06,740 --> 01:12:09,200
No one has ever returned 
from the core of the darkness...

621
01:12:09,410 --> 01:12:10,830
...where the demon lies in wait.

622
01:12:11,030 --> 01:12:12,450
She's not gonna help us. 
Let's go.

623
01:12:12,660 --> 01:12:15,200
If you wish to face the demon 
to find your daughter...

624
01:12:15,410 --> 01:12:16,580
...I won't stop you.

625
01:12:16,790 --> 01:12:19,460
- Christabella, they can't go down... 
- Silence, Adam.

626
01:12:23,210 --> 01:12:25,880
Perhaps your faith will protect you.

627
01:12:26,340 --> 01:12:28,380
Perhaps not.

628
01:12:42,270 --> 01:12:44,480
If you don't wanna do this...

629
01:12:45,490 --> 01:12:47,490
...I'll understand.

630
01:12:48,700 --> 01:12:50,660
Sharon's adopted...

631
01:12:51,570 --> 01:12:52,780
...but I'm her mother.

632
01:12:52,990 --> 01:12:56,080
I knew that from the moment 
I first laid eyes on her.

633
01:12:58,410 --> 01:13:00,290
She's lucky to have you.

634
01:13:01,750 --> 01:13:04,420
Mother is God in the eyes of a child.

635
01:14:15,370 --> 01:14:16,780
Quiet.

636
01:14:17,080 --> 01:14:19,620
We're in his domain now.

637
01:14:25,080 --> 01:14:27,380
Look at this map. Memorize it.

638
01:14:28,380 --> 01:14:30,510
Your memory may save your life.

639
01:14:31,920 --> 01:14:34,890
- Do you see this room? 
- Yeah.

640
01:14:35,050 --> 01:14:37,760
That is where the darkness lies.

641
01:14:37,970 --> 01:14:40,390
The demon is in the bowels 
of this building.

642
01:14:40,560 --> 01:14:42,940
It hides behind the face 
of an innocent.

643
01:14:43,140 --> 01:14:44,440
You mean a child?

644
01:14:44,650 --> 01:14:46,900
Don't believe your eyes. 
Your eyes will lie to you.

645
01:14:47,110 --> 01:14:50,190
Faith is the only truth.

646
01:14:51,240 --> 01:14:52,450
I will pray for you, Rose...

647
01:14:52,650 --> 01:14:54,990
...but I won't expect you 
and your friend to return.

648
01:14:56,780 --> 01:14:58,330
Goodbye.

649
01:15:00,750 --> 01:15:02,120
Adam.

650
01:15:03,330 --> 01:15:05,830
Left. Right.

651
01:15:06,540 --> 01:15:08,880
Left. Left.

652
01:15:10,090 --> 01:15:14,010
- Right. Right. Left. 
- Take them to the lower level.

653
01:15:14,220 --> 01:15:16,010
- In the basement? 
- Do it, then return.

654
01:15:16,220 --> 01:15:18,600
- Left. 3A. 
- But...

655
01:15:18,760 --> 01:15:20,350
- Right. 4A. 
- I said, do it.

656
01:15:21,180 --> 01:15:24,690
- Left. Left. Right. 
- Rose. Rose.

657
01:15:25,270 --> 01:15:29,730
- Left. Right. Left. Left. 
- Rose, she's killing you.

658
01:15:29,940 --> 01:15:32,280
- Rose! 
- Let me do this.

659
01:15:33,280 --> 01:15:35,400
I need to do this.

660
01:15:53,460 --> 01:15:55,010
Take this.

661
01:15:55,220 --> 01:15:59,050
They'll be drawn to the light, 
but you won't be able to see without it.

662
01:16:01,890 --> 01:16:03,600
Thank you.

663
01:16:09,980 --> 01:16:12,780
- So this thing actually works? 
- It will.

664
01:16:12,980 --> 01:16:14,940
If the demon wants you, it will.

665
01:16:17,150 --> 01:16:18,360
Forgive me.

666
01:16:19,780 --> 01:16:22,450
We've lived too long as scavengers. 
I believe this is yours.

667
01:16:30,080 --> 01:16:32,800
Witch! Her child's 
the likeness of Alessa.

668
01:16:33,000 --> 01:16:34,340
Her child's the next vessel.

669
01:16:34,510 --> 01:16:37,340
Stop her! 
Don't let the witches go down!

670
01:16:42,180 --> 01:16:43,720
Come on!

671
01:16:53,320 --> 01:16:54,610
Get off her!

672
01:16:56,820 --> 01:16:58,110
Find her.

673
01:16:58,860 --> 01:17:01,490
No! Wait! Cybil!

674
01:17:01,700 --> 01:17:03,830
Cybil! Open the door!

675
01:17:26,720 --> 01:17:29,350
No!

676
01:18:58,020 --> 01:18:59,610
8A.

677
01:19:00,150 --> 01:19:04,450
7 A. Right.

678
01:19:14,540 --> 01:19:17,750
Right. 6A.

679
01:19:19,210 --> 01:19:21,130
4A.

680
01:19:22,170 --> 01:19:24,010
3A.

681
01:19:26,640 --> 01:19:29,350
Left, left. Right, right.

682
01:19:29,560 --> 01:19:32,220
Left, left.

683
01:24:42,700 --> 01:24:44,580
The child is mine!

684
01:24:44,790 --> 01:24:46,750
Mine!

685
01:24:52,290 --> 01:24:54,170
She's mine.

686
01:24:55,960 --> 01:24:57,840
She's mine!

687
01:25:21,820 --> 01:25:23,330
Let's go.

688
01:25:26,040 --> 01:25:29,120
Out of the car. Turn around.

689
01:25:44,180 --> 01:25:46,140
Just a friendly warning...

690
01:25:46,720 --> 01:25:49,180
...I'll be back with people 
who know what they're doing.

691
01:25:52,020 --> 01:25:55,730
Before you do that, Chris, 
I wanna tell you about Officer Bennett.

692
01:25:57,360 --> 01:26:00,360
Few years back, some wacko, 
he abducted a kid...

693
01:26:00,570 --> 01:26:03,700
...threw him down a mine vent 
up there in Silent Hill.

694
01:26:04,120 --> 01:26:06,370
Cybil Bennett, she found that boy.

695
01:26:06,580 --> 01:26:08,290
She spent three days 
holding onto him...

696
01:26:08,500 --> 01:26:10,660
...keeping him alive 
until they were rescued.

697
01:26:10,870 --> 01:26:12,330
We know what we're doing.

698
01:26:12,540 --> 01:26:14,500
I need to do everything I can.

699
01:26:21,470 --> 01:26:23,260
Let's go.

700
01:26:46,950 --> 01:26:49,160
Please. 
Christabella, let her live.

701
01:26:49,370 --> 01:26:51,580
Your weakness 
led these souls to judgment.

702
01:26:51,790 --> 01:26:54,080
- This time you will bear witness. 
- She is innocent.

703
01:26:54,250 --> 01:26:57,250
Look at her. 
She's the whelp of your daughter.

704
01:26:57,460 --> 01:26:58,670
The demon!

705
01:26:59,250 --> 01:27:04,470
The demon fathered this disgusting 
abomination from her child!

706
01:27:04,680 --> 01:27:05,720
No, she's mine!

707
01:27:08,890 --> 01:27:10,930
Sharon. Sharon, look at me.

708
01:27:11,140 --> 01:27:13,730
Look at me. Don't be afraid.

709
01:27:13,940 --> 01:27:16,480
It's okay, it's okay. 
Your mama's coming.

710
01:27:18,190 --> 01:27:21,860
Once again we are called upon 
to restore innocence.

711
01:27:22,070 --> 01:27:25,950
We burn this witch. 
We vanquish evil.

712
01:27:26,870 --> 01:27:29,030
No. You can't. You can't.

713
01:27:29,240 --> 01:27:31,870
- Don't let her say this! No! 
- We burn the child!

714
01:27:32,080 --> 01:27:34,250
We fight the demon!

715
01:27:37,290 --> 01:27:38,540
She's just a child!

716
01:27:38,750 --> 01:27:41,670
What the fuck is wrong 
with you people?

717
01:27:42,130 --> 01:27:44,090
Let her go!

718
01:27:44,550 --> 01:27:46,760
Leave her alone!

719
01:27:46,970 --> 01:27:48,600
Leave her alone!

720
01:27:49,300 --> 01:27:51,140
Those who aid the demon...

721
01:27:51,350 --> 01:27:55,140
...they must be cleansed 
by the fire from whence they came.

722
01:27:55,350 --> 01:27:57,940
That's crazy. You're crazy.

723
01:27:58,690 --> 01:28:00,860
No!

724
01:28:01,070 --> 01:28:02,690
Why are you listening to this?

725
01:28:02,900 --> 01:28:05,200
Why?

726
01:28:07,030 --> 01:28:09,990
<i>Burn the witch! Burn her!</i>

727
01:28:10,160 --> 01:28:15,290
<i>Burn the witch! Burn her! 
Burn the witch!</i>

728
01:28:22,340 --> 01:28:24,130
Sharon.

729
01:28:31,350 --> 01:28:33,390
Evil witch!

730
01:28:34,350 --> 01:28:36,310
Suffer.

731
01:28:40,770 --> 01:28:43,400
<i>Burn the witch! Burn her!</i>

732
01:28:43,610 --> 01:28:47,360
<i>Burn the witch! Burn her!</i>

733
01:28:52,780 --> 01:28:55,160
Oh, my God.

734
01:29:02,290 --> 01:29:04,630
You're in your own hell.

735
01:29:12,800 --> 01:29:16,520
Mama, be with me.

736
01:29:39,920 --> 01:29:41,790
Here is where the apocalypse began.

737
01:29:42,000 --> 01:29:44,840
This is where we stopped 
the annihilation of the world.

738
01:29:45,050 --> 01:29:47,510
We drew a line in the sand 
and said:

739
01:29:47,710 --> 01:29:50,180
''Demon, you will not cross!''

740
01:29:50,380 --> 01:29:54,010
But the demon is wicked, 
full of treachery.

741
01:29:54,220 --> 01:29:58,390
Yet again he comes to tempt us 
in the guise of an innocent.

742
01:29:58,600 --> 01:30:00,600
To rid the world of this demon...

743
01:30:00,810 --> 01:30:03,440
...we must burn this child!

744
01:30:05,270 --> 01:30:06,360
That's not gonna happen!

745
01:30:10,320 --> 01:30:11,280
Mommy!

746
01:30:12,410 --> 01:30:15,780
It's okay, baby. 
Everything's gonna be okay.

747
01:30:15,990 --> 01:30:17,700
Oh, my God.

748
01:30:17,910 --> 01:30:19,080
Oh, my God.

749
01:30:20,210 --> 01:30:22,330
What have you people done?

750
01:30:22,540 --> 01:30:25,790
- You have returned. 
- Yes, I have.

751
01:30:26,420 --> 01:30:28,420
The witch has returned.

752
01:30:31,420 --> 01:30:35,050
Do not believe her lies.

753
01:30:35,470 --> 01:30:37,430
I come from a world 
outside this place.

754
01:30:37,930 --> 01:30:39,680
I come from a world full of life!

755
01:30:43,190 --> 01:30:44,690
Why don't you tell them the truth.

756
01:30:44,900 --> 01:30:48,320
Tell them the truth that you deny, 
even to yourself.

757
01:30:48,530 --> 01:30:50,690
There was no apocalypse!

758
01:30:50,900 --> 01:30:52,900
You burned in the fire 
that you started...

759
01:30:53,110 --> 01:30:56,450
...and nothing can save you 
because you're already damned!

760
01:30:58,290 --> 01:30:59,620
- Mommy! 
- Take her.

761
01:30:59,120 --> 01:31:02,370
Burn her. Burn her as a witch.

762
01:31:02,080 --> 01:31:05,580
Burn her! Burn her!

763
01:31:06,000 --> 01:31:07,290
Demon witch!

764
01:31:07,500 --> 01:31:09,090
- Burn me? 
- Demon witch.

765
01:31:09,300 --> 01:31:11,210
That's your answer.

766
01:31:11,800 --> 01:31:13,760
Burn anything you're afraid of.

767
01:31:13,970 --> 01:31:16,470
Burn anything you can't control.

768
01:31:18,390 --> 01:31:21,810
This woman uses your fear 
to control you.

769
01:31:22,020 --> 01:31:24,560
She led you to burn 
Alessa Gillespie.

770
01:31:24,770 --> 01:31:27,610
She led you to burn 
an innocent child.

771
01:31:27,810 --> 01:31:30,980
But you will not deny your guilt...

772
01:31:31,190 --> 01:31:33,740
...and you cannot deny her pain!

773
01:31:33,950 --> 01:31:37,120
That child was sin incarnate.

774
01:31:37,620 --> 01:31:41,120
No, it's you who have sinned.

775
01:31:42,410 --> 01:31:45,460
You darkened the heart 
of an innocent...

776
01:31:45,670 --> 01:31:49,500
...and now you cower in the face 
of Alessa's revenge.

777
01:31:49,710 --> 01:31:51,670
- Sinner. 
- Heresy.

778
01:31:51,880 --> 01:31:53,920
Burn her. Burn her!

779
01:31:55,260 --> 01:31:59,300
Your faith brings death!

780
01:32:00,680 --> 01:32:02,600
You are alone in this limbo...

781
01:32:02,810 --> 01:32:05,560
...and God is not here.

782
01:32:06,980 --> 01:32:08,020
Mommy!

783
01:32:21,410 --> 01:32:25,460
